ine-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200652421747_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260620/202606200652421747_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯战报】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/match1869179date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大胜！西班牙4-0沙特升小组第1 亚马尔首球奥亚萨瓦尔2射1传+中柱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260622/zhanbao_image_1869179_1782064155_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260622/zhanbao_image_1869179_1782064155_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260622/zhanbao_image_1869179_1782064155_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>西班牙4分暂升H组榜首！奥亚萨瓦尔2射1传，18岁亚马尔世界杯首球，库库造乌龙，费兰失单刀。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/match1869173date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">冷门！十人比利时0-0伊朗 贝兰万德神扑塔雷米进球被吹+造直红</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260622/zhanbao_image_1869173_1782074991_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260622/zhanbao_image_1869173_1782074991_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260622/zhanbao_image_1869173_1782074991_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>两队前两轮均战平！比利时狂射22脚，贝兰万德神扑，塔雷米进球被吹+造直红。</p><p><strong>【世界杯数据】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a3801b21bf48native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">闪耀世界杯！18岁亚马尔破门，打进世界杯首球&amp;成第8年轻进球者</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220036082092.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220036082092.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220036082092.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯H组西班牙vs沙特，亚马尔第10分钟破门。这是亚马尔个人世界杯首球，他也凭借18岁零343天的年龄成为世界杯历史第8年轻的进球者。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a3863db0eb5bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">佛得角队史世界杯首球！皮纳超远任意球重炮，攻破乌拉圭球门！</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.56" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220733203957.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220733203957.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220733203957.jpg"> </div><p>乌拉圭vs佛得角第21分钟，凯文・皮纳任意球直接射门打入世界波，佛得角取得队史在世界杯上第一粒进球！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a38663f5d836native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">佛得角第二轮终破门！本届4支新军已全部解锁队史世界杯正赛首球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.71" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251206/202512060939028792.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.71" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.71" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251206/202512060939028792_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251206/202512060939028792_720.jpg"> </div><p>来到小组赛第二轮，本届世界杯四支新军——佛得角、库拉索、约旦、乌兹别克斯坦均已解锁在世界杯正赛中的首个进球。</p><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a382bb68756dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">亚马尔：世界杯首球像梦一样 上一届世界杯我还在教室里看球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/6a380ec7bb094.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/6a380ec7bb094.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/6a380ec7bb094.jpg"> </div><p>世界杯小组赛H组第2轮，西班牙4-0大胜沙特，亚马尔赛后接受DAZN采访。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a3840a0b8086native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">沙特球迷首轮嘲讽“亚马尔在哪”，亚马尔今天进球回应：我在这儿</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.57" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220353386866.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.57" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.57" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220353386866.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220353386866.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙4-0大胜沙特赛后，亚马尔社媒发文庆祝胜利，还回应了沙特球迷：“我在这儿。加油西班牙！感谢所有人的支持，愿上帝永远与我们同在。”</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a3835c4b7529native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">秀恩爱！女友现场见证亚马尔世界杯首球，亚马尔评论：我的女孩</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220308087487_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220308087487_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220308087487_720.jpg"> </div><p>西班牙4-0大胜沙特，本场比赛，亚马尔女友Inés García再次现场观战，她在社媒分享了照片。亚马尔赛后也到女友社媒评论：“我的女孩!!!!!!!🙂‍↔️。”</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a38528434a4bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">大跌眼镜！FIFA第10比利时世界杯2连平，5亿阵容2场38射只进1球</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220517586979_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220517586979_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220517586979_1280.jpg"> </div><p>比利时0-0战平伊朗，本届世界杯开始前，比利时的FIFA排名是世界第10，但小组赛前两战，比利时面对FIFA第30埃及和FIFA第22伊朗，38脚射门只靠对手乌龙打进一球，目前以2分排名G组第二。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a3840c1c28e1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆巴佩：我就知道梅西会进球，他总能进球，而我现在还排在他后面</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a3844cd1a2dcnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">姆巴佩：如果我们占优补水确实打乱节奏，不过天气热的时候会很好</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220353424691.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220353424691_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220353424691_720.jpg"> </div><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a3809beecdbfnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">麦卡：梅西独一无二，考虑到他的身份，我学到的是人格魅力和谦逊</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.45" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a321cd0c76f7.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.45" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.45" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a321cd0c76f7.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a321cd0c76f7.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯小组赛第二轮，阿根廷即将对阵奥地利。赛前阿根廷中场麦卡利斯特接受了来自TYC的采访，对队长梅西赞不绝口。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a38158be4f05native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">换个感觉！阿根廷发型师晒照：梅西战奥地利前理发，德保罗也出镜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220047187839.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220047187839.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260622/202606220047187839.jpg"> </div><p>美加墨世界杯小组赛第二轮，阿根廷即将对阵奥地利。赛前阿根廷队发型师Dany Ale在个人社媒晒出照片，为梅西修理发型，而德保罗也出现在了镜头中。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-06-22/6a384b5fc0a00native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">镜报：梅西有望在迈阿密踢世界杯淘汰赛，安保高度戒备迎大批球迷</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260617/6a322a7610a95.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; 